---
import Layout from '../../../../layouts/Layout.astro'
import DayRating from '../../rateDay/rateDay.astro'

export const post = {
  day: 6,
  title: 'Day 6',
  date: '2026-09-11',
  description: 'sixth day, of daily',
  category: 'Daily',
  tags: ['Astro', 'Tailwind CSS', 'Web Development'],
}
---

<Layout>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 pb-24 pt-32">
    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="mb-16">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-sm">
        <span
          class="font-medium uppercase tracking-widest text-[var(--secondary)]"
        >
          {post.category}
        </span>

        <span class="text-[var(--border)]">/</span>

        <span class="text-[var(--muted)]">
          Day {post.day}
        </span>
      </div>

      <h1
        class="mt-6 text-4xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl"
      >
        {post.title}
      </h1>

      <p class="mt-5 text-sm text-[var(--muted)]">
        {
          new Date(post.date).toLocaleDateString('en-GB', {
            day: 'numeric',
            month: 'long',
            year: 'numeric',
          })
        }
      </p>

      <p
        class="mt-8 border-l-2 border-[var(--secondary)] pl-5 text-lg leading-8 text-[var(--muted)] sm:text-xl"
      >
        {post.description}
      </p>
    </header>

    <!-- Content -->
    <div class="space-y-14 leading-8">
      <!-- Section -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="mb-5 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl">
          What I did today?
        </h2>
        <p>
          Today (habits done), I was thining about my idea for a business, and I
          think i found 2 people that can help me with my idea, but its still to
          fast to say, I was in work, I wrote that I'll listen english podcast
          but I changed my mind I almost finish audiobook about startups, but my
          phone dead before, I also decided to learn Next.js I think it may be a
          key for my business, I'll create new section in blog about what I
          learn about Next.js becouse I'll spent most of my time learning
          desing, and Next.js
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>

    <!-- Section -->
    <section class="py-5">
      <h2 class="mb-5 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl">
        Plans for tomorrow
      </h2>

      <p>
        I'll meet one of this people that can be helpful for me, and my business
        We'll talk about details, and He'll decide is he interest, After that
        I'll go to work, and I'll end audiobook abuts startups, and start
        another one, I hope I'll have time to learn Next.js
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Section -->
    <section>
      <h2 class="mb-5 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl">
        How I rate this day
      </h2>
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <p>
          I'll give 7/10, I did't do my plan, but I decided to do other things
          that were more important for me in that moment, so I think it's fine
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
    <DayRating class="w-full" rating={7} />
  </article>
</Layout>
